## Why This Is Asked

Assesses practical E2E skills: gating UX with feature flags, deterministic tests, data seeding, and test isolation using Cypress or Playwright.

## Key Concepts

- Feature flags and gating
- Test data seeding per run
- LocalStorage state as idempotence marker
- Network/mocks to deterministically simulate flag responses
- Time-bounded execution for beginner scenarios

## Code Example

```javascript
// Playwright skeleton
test('onboarding respects flag', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.route('**/flags**', r => r.fulfill({ status: 200, body: JSON.stringify({ onboarding: true }) }));
  await page.goto('https://app.local/');
  await expect(page.locator('#onboard-modal')).toBeVisible();
  await page.locator('#finish').click();
  const stored = await page.evaluate(() => localStorage.getItem('onboarding_complete'));
  expect(stored).toBe('true');
  await page.reload();
  await expect(page.locator('#onboard-modal')).toBeHidden();
});
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you extend this to multi-tenant setups with per-tenant flag overrides?
- How would you ensure the test remains reliable when the flag toggles during a session?

## Why This Is Asked
This question evaluates the candidate's understanding of end-to-end testing for real-time, distributed systems with regional routing, data consistency, and feature flag safety.

## Key Concepts
- End-to-end testing of event-driven pipelines, cross-region latency, and eventual consistency
- Test data isolation and deterministic environments via mocks and seed data
- Idempotency, replay safety, and rollback semantics for feature flags
- Instrumentation hooks to seed Kafka, mock external feeds, and reset Redis

## Code Example
```javascript
// Playwright test scaffold for the trading alert pipeline
const { test, expect } = require('@playwright/test');

test.describe('Multi-Region Alerting System', () => {
  let kafkaSeeder;
  let redisClient;
  let mockExternalFeed;

  test.beforeEach(async () => {
    // Seed isolated test data per region
    await redisClient.flushdb();
    await kafkaSeeder.seedEvents([
      { region: 'us-east', symbol: 'AAPL', threshold: 150 },
      { region: 'eu-west', symbol: 'BMW', threshold: 85 },
    ]);
    mockExternalFeed.setDeterministicResponse({ AAPL: { price: 152 }, BMW: { price: 87 } });
  });

  test('alerts propagate to correct regional dashboards', async ({ page }) => {
    await page.goto('https://dashboard.trading.example.com');
    await expect(page.locator('.alert').first()).toBeVisible({ timeout: 5000 });

    // Verify cross-region routing
    const alerts = await page.locator('.alert').all();
    expect(alerts).toHaveLength(2);
  });

  test('feature flag rollback triggers correctly', async ({ page }) => {
    await page.goto('https://dashboard.trading.example.com');
    await page.evaluate(() => window.triggerRollback());
    await expect(page.locator('.rollback-success')).toBeVisible();
  });
});
```
